drop 0
eat 1
drop 1
break 3
eat 0
drop 0
eat 1
drop 1
continue 2
eat 0
drop 0
eat 1
drop 1
return 30
eat 0
drop 0
eat 1
drop 1
fail stop 3
eat 0
drop 0
eat 1
drop 1
